sequenceDiagram
    participant SRC as Источник
    participant RAW as topic: video.raw / audio.raw
    participant V as Визуальный детектор
    participant A as Акустический детектор
    participant INF as topic: inference
    participant F as Модуль слияния
    participant DEC as topic: decisions
    participant S as Sink / Dashboard
    SRC->>RAW: publish кадр (ts, jpeg)
    SRC->>RAW: publish окно (ts, pcm)
    RAW->>V: consume(кадры)
    V->>V: детекция YOLOv8 + ассоциация ByteTrack
    RAW->>A: consume(аудио-окна)
    A->>A: спектрограмма / MFCC → CNN / AST
    V->>INF: produce(ts, video, label, conf, bbox, track_id, latency)
    A->>INF: produce(ts, audio, label, conf, latency)
    INF->>F: consume(inference)
    F->>F: выравнивание по окну ε; late/hybrid + gating
    F->>DEC: produce(ts, decision, conf, contributions)
    DEC->>S: consume(decisions)
    S->>S: лог + метрики F1/FPS/latency/Δt + визуализация
